{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, chill game about managing a ramen stall-front to distribute contraband 'cute-ware' to the masses in rebellion against a nation-wide strict anti-aesthetic policy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a year ushering in peace after a large civil war broke out and claimed millions of lives in the city, the triumphant party declared a nation-wide policy of anti-aesthetics, leading a propaganda campaign to blame the war on 'vapid aesthetics' and 'excessive emphasis on frivolous positivity'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any article found to be cute will immediately be deemed contraband and illegal to possess. You are tasked by the Rebellion to subvert the Ministry's narrative by distributing various 'cute-ware' to the masses via a ramen stall front.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full game vs Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the demo is a earlier version of the game and lacks many things that the full game features such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation of all modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher tier forging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story and other story developments incorporated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Population mood management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More gachapon machines and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >many more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect a wide variety of items from various gachapon machines to supply your agenda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/1e86f59e9fddc82c53b8396b9405b92d.poster.avif?t=1757844193\" width=780 height=